  "title": "博客下划线格式修改",
  "summary": "「总是觉得蓝色有点碍眼。」",
  "content": "<h2>致谢</h2><p>借鉴<a href=\"https://yihui.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">谢益辉</a>博客的下划线样式（好像只在他这里看到过这个样式），New Yorker 也有类似，样式更华美</p><h2>改就行了</h2><p>只把有变色的地方改了，也就是仅调整了 <code>post</code> 下 <code>post-content</code> 的 <code>a</code>（超链接）的样式</p><p>文件路径：<code>\\themes\\maupassant\\source\\css\\style.scss</code></p><h3>p 标签（注意保持前后文缩进）</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>a {</span><br><span>    color: #01579f;</span><br><span>    padding-bottom: 2px;</span><br><span>    word-break: break-all;</span><br><span>    &amp;:hover {</span><br><span>        text-decoration: underline;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>改为</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>a {</span><br><span>    color: #444;</span><br><span>    padding-bottom: 2px;</span><br><span>    word-break: break-all;</span><br><span>    text-decoration: none;</span><br><span>    border-bottom: 0.5px solid;</span><br><span>    &amp;:hover {</span><br><span>      border-bottom: none;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3>ul 和 ol 标签（注意保持前后文缩进）</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>a {</span><br><span>    color: #01579f;</span><br><span>    padding-bottom: 2px;</span><br><span>    word-break: break-all;</span><br><span>    &amp;:hover {</span><br><span>        text-decoration: underline;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>改为</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>a {</span><br><span>    color: #444;</span><br><span>    padding-bottom: 2px;</span><br><span>    word-break: break-all;</span><br><span>    text-decoration: none;</span><br><span>    border-bottom: 0.5px solid;</span><br><span>    &amp;:hover {</span><br><span>      border-bottom: none;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3>td 标签（注意保持前后文缩进）</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>td {</span><br><span>    padding: 5px 10px;</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>改为</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>td {</span><br><span>    padding: 5px 10px;</span><br><span>    a {</span><br><span>        color: #444;</span><br><span>        padding-bottom: 2px;</span><br><span>        word-break: break-all;</span><br><span>        text-decoration: none;</span><br><span>        border-bottom: 0.5px solid;</span><br><span>        &amp;:hover {</span><br><span>          border-bottom: none;</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2>部署</h2><p><code>hexo g -d</code></p><hr><p>CHANGELOG</p><ul><li>20200318 Arlmy 创建、发布</li></ul>",
